e Jennifer Coolidge who plays an  extremely wealthy guest named Tanya  during the scene Tanya scatters her  mother's ashes off the side of the boat  I brought my mother's ashes with me  I could spread them in the ocean however  while filming Rothwell found herself  becoming distracted by the fascinating  sea life surrounding them including some  whales as Rothwell told The Hollywood  Reporter I'm trying to be in the scene  but there's a whale breaching and it was  just magical it was Unreal  season 2 of The White Lotus is filled to  the brim with actions that may or may  not have secret meanings one of the most  fascinating examples of this is when  Cameron played by Theo James kisses his  former college roommate Ethan played by  Will sharp on the cheek the cheek  kissing adds some depth to Cameron and  Ethan's relationship which is extra fun  given the fact that the first one was  actually improvised in an interview with  variety sharp revealed that the cheek  kisses weren't planned recalling those  party scenes were actually very Loosely  scripted it was really improvisatory and  they would cut it in the edit and use  the most helpful bits there has been a  lot of speculation about why Cameron  kisses his friend so often on Reddit  some people are convinced that they're  more than just friends which might  explain why Ethan and his wife Harper  don't have sex but sharp has a different  interpretation of the action telling  variety I think it's Cameron's way of  being playful and sexually voracious and  showing who's boss in this weird way  it's like a micro Power Play Jennifer  coolidge's character Tanya an alcoholic  grieving the recent death of her mother  instantly became a fan favorite the  actor's performance in the White Lotus  was so well received that it earned  Coolidge her first ever Emmy Award in  2022 but what some people may not know  is that coolidge's iconic performances  Tanya almost didn't happen in an  interview with the guardian the actor  revealed I was really affected by the  pandemic I was reading tragic news  stories on a daily basis I knew people  who lost their lives and was convinced  we wouldn't make it through I wasn't  thinking about work because I didn't  think we'd be alive things changed  however when Creator Mike White called  her up and said he'd written a role for  her Coolidge was surprised when white  told her that they'd be filming right  away and that she needed to hop on a  plane to Hawaii however Coolidge wasn't  so sure telling the guardian I'd been  gorging and self-destructing at home for  months eating pizza all day there was no  way I wanted to be on film despite her  reservations about the project the  Legally Blonde star eventually signed up  and ended up becoming one of the show's  standout characters the fact that  Coolidge almost turned down her role in  The White Lotus makes her performance  all the more special as she told the  guard I can't tell you how close I came  to ruining this whole thing for myself  so let's have fun okay  the White Lotus can get pretty risque at  times after all the show features  honeymooning couples and extramarital  Affairs of Plenty it might come as a  surprise then that the show's writer and  Creator Mike White isn't the biggest fan  of shooting these intimate moments in an  interview with NPR white admitted there  were definitely times on this shoot that  I was like what have I got myself into  my threshold for awkwardness is very low  luckily for him the show's actors were  uninhibited which made the entire  filming process much easier as the  enlightened writer told NPR that was new  terrain for me it just felt like it was  important because it really is baked  into the narrative  in season one of the White Lotus Steve  zahn's character neurotic dad Mark  mossbacker has a full frontal nude scene  fearing that he has testicular cancer he  shows his wife Nicole played by Connie  Britton his symptoms zonn actually wore  a prosthetic penis for the shoot and got  to approve the appendage himself despite  being shocked by the scenes on told GQ  it's so abrupt the way Mike White did it  was just great it's like bam first  episode so HBO isn't it season two of  The White Lotus is also filled with wild  and shocking moments one of the most  surprising scenes is the one in which  Cameron gets naked after the episode  aired viewers quickly took to Twitter to  discuss whether or not Theo James was  wearing a prosthetic penis on screen  fans finally got their answer when James  revealed that likes on in season 1 he  was actually wearing a prosthetic joking  about the size of the fake appendage  James said on The Tonight Show starring  Jimmy Fallon the thing is ginormous and  being the director Mike White are  sitting there going that's average  in the second season of the White Lotus  Haley Lou Richardson plays Porsha  Tanya's gen Z assistant quickly  Porsche's colorful idiosyncratic outfits  became one of the most discussed things  about the White Lotus each episode many  fans have critiqued the outfits with one  Twitter user writing Porsche gave us one  cute outfit now she's back to dressing  like a Polly Pocket doll who lost half  her luggage another user painfully noted  Porsche's outfits always look like a  toddler got dressed and demanded to wear  very random and specific things together  Alex Bovaird who has served as the  costume designer for both seasons of The  White Lotus revealed that there is a  reason Porsche dress is the way she does  in an interview with people she  explained my inspiration was from  research online Instagram and also in  person at coffee shops and other  Hangouts in the kind of neighborhoods  Porsha would live in in Los Angeles like  Highland Park there's nothing like  actually going to the places my  characters would actually exist in and  soaking up the fashion Megan Fahey who  plays Cameron's wife Daphne in season 2  of The White Lotus has quickly risen two  fan favorite status since making her  debut on the show what some fans might  not know is that Fahey was originally  gunning for the role of Rachel in season  one of the White Lotus which ultimately  went to Alexandra Daddario she was  undoubtedly disappointed about not  getting the role but Fahey admitted that  it was probably the right choice telling  women's wear daily the thing that  Creator Mike White does so well is that  he always casts the perfect person and  you watch the show and you're like I  can't imagine that being anyone else he  just has a knack for knowing exactly who  the person is  in season one of the White Lotus Mark  discovers that his late father was gay  this is an interesting narrative Arc for  Mark but more than that it actually  Bears similarities to Creator Mike  White's own life  he had two lives  he had his family  and then he had another life his dad Mel  White was an Evangelical Pastor who  ghost wrote for figures such as  religious broadcaster Pat Robertson and  Evangelist Billy Graham due to his  association with right-wing politics it  probably came as a surprise to many when  Mel came out as gay in 1993. he  subsequently became an activist and  wrote a book called stranger at the gate  to be gay and Christian in America Mike  White is clearly close with his father  after winning the Emmy Award for  outstanding directing for a limited  series for the first season of The White  Lotus he gave a shout out to his parents  saying I love my parents my mom let me  be the weird kid that I wanted to be and  my dad who's struggling right now thank  you so much for letting me honor him  tonight  season one of the White Lotus was shot  under the restrictive umbrella of covet  19. and while that likely came with a  lot of frustrating red tape it also had  its benefits as Alexandra Daddario  explained to Forbes it was amazing to  get to do what I love to do with such  incredible people and I think the focus  on health and the world around us made  us appreciate what we were doing so much  more Daddario also noted that the entire  cast was forced to lean on each other  when times got tough during the shoot  telling Forbes there was gratitude and  also the pain of being quarantined from  family and friends so we all supported  each other and helped each other while  also feeling immense joy and gratitude  appreciation for her cast mates wasn't  the only thing that Daddario developed  during the pandemic she revealed that  after wearing mostly sweats and pajamas  for more than a year getting to wear  glamorous outfits on the White Lotus was  a real treat she explained I have a  newfound appreciation for style and  getting dressed up when it comes to the  White Lotus part of the fun is that each  season takes place in a new location  rumor has it that season 3 which has  already been ordered by HBO will take  place somewhere in Asia in October 2022  Mike White told deadline I think it'd be  fun to maybe go to a whole different  continent you know we did Europe and  maybe Asia something crazy like that  that would be fun costume designer Alex  Bovaird seemed to agree with white  telling people I've seen in interviews  that Mike has said he has his eye on  somewhere in Asia for season three so  I'll just say somewhere like Japan while  there's no concrete info on the White  Lotus season 3 just yet there's some  reason to believe that Connie Britton  may be reprising her season one role as  Nicole the Friday Night Live star told  deadline Mike White wanted me to be in  the second season and there was an idea  that I loved for the character Our  intention is to do it in the third  season a piece of casting didn't work in  the second season I would love to see a  spin-off on every character in that show  if the White Lotus keeps on earning rave  reviews there's no telling how many  seasons we might end up with  foreign

